@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Candidate circuit breaker — scoped dependency admission state
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

state "Closed\nEligible calls may proceed" as C
state "Open\nNew protected calls refused/deferred safely" as O
state "Half-open\nBounded safe probe only" as H
[*] --> C
C --> C : successful eligible observation
C --> O : evaluated failure predicate reached
O --> O : reject/defer new work; preserve pending attempt truth
O --> H : reviewed cooldown + probe admission
H --> C : required healthy probe evidence
H --> O : failed / insufficient probe evidence
note bottom of H
 No numeric threshold/cooldown or breaker product is selected.
 Probe must be an actually safe supported check, not a duplicate send/deploy.
 Dependency admission state never rewrites unknown business effects as failures.
 Multi-process state scope and coordination need an explicit implementation contract.
end note
@enduml
